  "summary": "The existing Rust preview frontend now runs real AgentSession interactions. Linux full preflight, Intel macOS native gates over SSH, native Windows Cargo checks, and an Opus 5.5 medium live smoke passed. Counts distinguish gates, Cargo tests, PTY scenarios, and the two live screen-mode runs. Supplemental Pi queue characterization tests were added in a test-only follow-up and passed on all three hosts. The initial test synchronization failure is retained. The paired eval covers shared CLI/session paths; interactive steering is covered separately by session and PTY tests. Scopes 14 and 15 remain open. The paired eval records 288 samples with no flagged regressions and 144 passing candidate samples; the Gemini alias substitution remains explicit.",
